do you need to monitor and protect large  amounts of sensitive data but aren't  always sure where that data is or how  it's being processed and managed today  we'll talk about automatic dlp a service  from google cloud that is built to  minimize the risk of sensitive data  being mishandled or exposed and help you  prevent privacy security and compliance  issues before we continue if you need a  refresher on what data loss prevention  is check out the link in the description  for our getting started with data loss  prevention playlist  first let's understand how dlp  inspection works the cloud dlp engine  inspects structured and unstructured  data and classifies it using what we  call info types our predefined data tags  out of the box dlp provides over 150  different info types including  personally identifiable information  financial data types global and region  specific types and more and you can  extend these with custom info types and  detection rules to meet your business's  needs  for example the dlp engine can tell you  where it found an instance of a credit  card number even giving you details down  to the byte offset where it was found  for bigquery an inspection job can be  configured to scan an individual table  in a data set this will leverage the dlp  engine to perform a deep scan of that  table to look for sensitive data  elements  info type classification can be used to  make informed decisions about how you  protect share and use your data the dlp  engine and inspection jobs are great at  deep scanning data to get very detailed  information  but when it comes to gaining visibility  across your entire organization across  thousands of projects filled with data  sets and tables  this skill can become unmanageable  pretty quickly and writing up some  custom code to scan every table can lead  to a lot of overhead to manage  so  we made dlp automatic and developed a  fully managed data profiling service  that takes away that overhead and pain  it gives you the same detection quality  as dlp and lets you protect data by  identifying where sensitive and high  risk data resides  automatically it generates a set of  metrics and insights or a data profile  from scanning the data among these  metrics are the protected info types  found in bigquery tables free text score  and data risk level  so you gain crucial insights into what  kind of at-risk data you are currently  storing allowing you to take the  appropriate steps to protect it  automatic dlp profiler scans are set up  with a simple configuration and will  scan all bigquery data sets and tables  in an entire organization folder or  project  you may be thinking  these wide scanning capabilities sound  great but what if i want to keep that  detailed view of my data  well you're in luck because this  automatic service was built to fit  perfectly with the previous dlp  functionality those inspection jobs we  talked about earlier  so you can get a view a mile wide and  when needed a mile deep when using these  together  and the fact that automatic dlp is fully  managed allows google cloud to take on  the overhead and allows you to focus on  the outcomes and your business  but wait there's more  continuous monitoring automatically  profiles any new tables you create  across your org and periodically  reprofiles the tables you modify  data profiles are generated in the same  geographical region that your data lives  in making sure to maintain your data  residency  and deep technical knowledge of coding  or embedding isn't necessary to use the  service you focus on configuring it to  your needs turning it on with one click  and consuming the results and you get  all of this with low overhead which  means you don't need to manage or  orchestrate your own jobs so scanning  across your org is a breeze  as a quick example let's say you have  150 000 tables across multiple projects  that you need to scan for sensitive data  like  social security numbers and email  addresses when you turn on automatic dlp  you'll see detailed metrics about each  table and column in your organization so  that you can assess your overall data  risk and gain insights on where you have  that sensitive data  executives who worry about maintaining  security and data compliance can see at  a high level where risks may lie and  data admins who are responsible for that  data can ensure all data is properly  permissioned or considered  de-identifying the data to protect it  and improve compliance  all that with just a few configuration  steps and the click of a button to turn  it on  easy peasy  so let's recap  automatic dlp will  help find sensitive data including in  unexpected places keep up with data  growth that makes it difficult to  manually inspect data and provide rich  insights about data and data risk  allowing you to manage data risk make  more informed decisions focus on the  outcome and ultimately help to safely  accelerate your business while we take  care of the rest thanks for watching  you
 

